{
  "summary": "This experiment tested transformer aggregation in a multi-profile RNA-only model using scvi_n200 encoder, achieving validation accuracy of 0.6530 and F1 of 0.6283, slightly higher than the avgpool baseline (config_004: 0.6501 accuracy, 0.6275 F1). The result suggests transformer aggregation may offer marginal benefits with scvi_n200, but the exact contribution of the aggregation method remains uncertain due to the small performance difference and potential confounding factors."
}

